Date: Tue, 27 Apr 2021 16:57:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] AIORI HDF5: Add support for chunking through
 '--hdf5.chunkSize=x' option

Add support for HDF5_Access

Add support for H5Fdelete

Remove H5Dget_space() call after dataset setup that was causing extra overhead

Reset ids to H5I_INVALID_HID after they're closed

Fix hints passed to MPIIO functions
